{"availability":"available","full":"diegoalvrezz/MammaScope-Demo","name":"MammaScope-Demo","description":"Public demo of MammaScope, a Streamlit-based tool for comparing immunohistochemistry (IHC) and MammaTyper molecular subtyping in breast cancer.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-16T20:42:41Z","updated":"2026-06-10T17:35:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mammascope-demo.streamlit.app/","topics":["bioinformatics","breast-cancer","clinical-data","concordance-analysis","health-engineering","ihc","immunohistochemistry","mammascope","mammatyper","medical-software","molecular-diagnostics","molecular-subtype","python","streamlit"],"demo":"https://mammascope-demo.streamlit.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.627Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.627Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.627Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.627Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Public demo of MammaScope, a clinical platform for integrating and comparing immunohistochemistry (IHC) and MammaTyper® RT-qPCR results in breast cancer molecular subtyping.","MammaScope automates the integration, processing and diagnostic concordance analysis between IHC results (from the Patwin hospital system) and MammaTyper® molecular reports (RT-qPCR). It was developed as a Bachelor's Thesis at the University of Burgos in collaboration with the Hospital Universitario de Burgos (HUBU).","The full application (private repository) includes authentication, role-based access control, audit logging and a configurable clinical settings panel. This demo exposes the full workflow with a simulated admin session and anonymized example files — no login required."],"features":["Load IHC Excel files (Patwin) and multiple MammaTyper® PDFs as a single batch","Automatic biomarker extraction via regex over free-text clinical narratives","St. Gallen 2013/2015 subtype classification algorithm (Luminal A, Luminal B HER2±, HER2-enriched, Triple negative)","Concordance statistics: Cohen's kappa with 95% CI, McNemar test, sensitivity, specificity, PPV, NPV, diagnostic OR","Automatic clinical alerts: discordances, HER2-low without documented score, values near cut-off thresholds, equivocal HER2 without SISH"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/diegoalvrezz/MammaScope-Demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ac3a43e1c1cc8df76545c5a99c1a6911b6ead2de248d9331d3183885e4b505d0","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.799Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.799Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Public demo of MammaScope, a clinical platform for integrating and comparing immunohistochemistry (IHC) and MammaTyper® RT-qPCR results in breast cancer molecular subtyping.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/diegoalvrezz/MammaScope-Demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"This demo exposes the full workflow with a simulated admin session and anonymized example files — no login required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/diegoalvrezz/MammaScope-Demo/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"ac3a43e1c1cc8df76545c5a99c1a6911b6ead2de248d9331d3183885e4b505d0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/diegoalvrezz/MammaScope-Demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.800Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-10T17:35:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/diegoalvrezz/MammaScope-Demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.800Z","hash":"ac3a43e1c1cc8df76545c5a99c1a6911b6ead2de248d9331d3183885e4b505d0","originalBytes":5869,"storedBytes":5869,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["demo","files","clinical","ihc","pdf","excel","license","mammascope","mammatyper","statistics","anonymized","automatic","burgos","concordance","data","database","example","extraction","full","hospital","module","pa